  "short_description": "每次挑戰截然不同，新戰利品、新敵人、新策略、新記憶。《Arkheron》是一款快節奏的俯視團隊 PvP 遊戲，戰鬥途中取得的物品都會改變你的玩法。帶上兩個好友一起爬上高塔，發揮出人意料的策略，奮力殺進下一層。",
  "short_description_en": "No two runs are ever the same. New loot, new enemies, new strategies, new memories. Arkheron is a fast-paced, isometric PvP where every item you grab rewrites how you play mid-fight. Take two friends up the Tower, pull off strats that shouldn’t work, and fight your way to the next floor.",
